  "brain_first": "“看这个空在句子里干什么：做主语、宾语、表示‘谁的’，还 是回指自己。”",
  "sort_order": 1053,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 81,
      "sourceIndex": 2249
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "括号给 he, they, we, I 等。",
      "sourcePage": 81,
      "sourceIndex": 2250
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 81,
      "sourceIndex": 2251
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Pronoun case/form：不同句法位置用不同形式。",
      "sourcePage": 81,
      "sourceIndex": 2252
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “看这个空在句子里干什么：做主语、宾语、表示‘谁的’，还",
      "sourcePage": 81,
      "sourceIndex": 2253
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "是回指自己。”",
      "sourcePage": 81,
      "sourceIndex": 2254
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 代词题靠位置判断，规则稳定。",
      "sourcePage": 81,
      "sourceIndex": 2255
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 81,
      "sourceIndex": 2256
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 空在谓语前、做动作的人 → 主格 I/he/she/we/they。",
      "sourcePage": 81,
      "sourceIndex": 2257
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 动词/介词后做对象 → 宾格 me/him/her/us/them。",
      "sourcePage": 81,
      "sourceIndex": 2258
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 空后紧跟名词 → 形容词性物主代词 my/his/their。",
      "sourcePage": 81,
      "sourceIndex": 2259
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 空后无名词但表示“某人的东西” → mine/his/theirs。",
      "sourcePage": 81,
      "sourceIndex": 2260
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5 主语和宾语同一人且强调“自己” → reflexive。",
      "sourcePage": 82,
      "sourceIndex": 2261
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 空格前后各画一条短线；标 pronoun? / contrast? / cause? / example?；两个",
      "sourcePage": 82,
      "sourceIndex": 2262
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "纠结选项写 A/B 再逐条验指代与逻辑。",
      "sourcePage": 82,
      "sourceIndex": 2263
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 82,
      "sourceIndex": 2264
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· by oneself = 独自",
      "sourcePage": 82,
      "sourceIndex": 2265
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· enjoy oneself = 玩得开心",
      "sourcePage": 82,
      "sourceIndex": 2266
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· teach oneself = 自学",
      "sourcePage": 82,
      "sourceIndex": 2267
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 代词形式与句中位置对应。",
      "sourcePage": 82,
      "sourceIndex": 2268
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 先把人名代回句子，再判断“谁做/对谁/谁的”。",
      "sourcePage": 82,
      "sourceIndex": 2269
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 82,
      "sourceIndex": 2270
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The students prepared the exhibition by ___ (they). 固定结构 by themselves。",
      "sourcePage": 82,
      "sourceIndex": 2271
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 82,
      "sourceIndex": 2272
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 介词后仍用主格。",
      "sourcePage": 82,
      "sourceIndex": 2273
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· their/theirs 混用。",
      "sourcePage": 82,
      "sourceIndex": 2274
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 82,
      "sourceIndex": 2275
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 空后有名词吗？",
      "sourcePage": 82,
      "sourceIndex": 2276
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 主客体是否同一人？",
      "sourcePage": 82,
      "sourceIndex": 2277
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： 7-P 代词指代｜7-L 逻辑关系｜7-T 主题链",
      "sourcePage": 82,
      "sourceIndex": 2278
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "｜7-O 位置不合理｜7-R 内容重复。",
      "sourcePage": 82,
      "sourceIndex": 2279
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 82,
      "sourceIndex": 2280
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 代词看位置：谁、对谁、谁的、自己。",
      "sourcePage": 82,
      "sourceIndex": 2281
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 82,
      "sourceIndex": 2283
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. ___ is my friend. (he)",
      "sourcePage": 82,
      "sourceIndex": 2284
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. I helped ___. (she)",
      "sourcePage": 82,
      "sourceIndex": 2285
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. This is ___ book. (I)",
      "sourcePage": 82,
      "sourceIndex": 2286
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. The book is ___. (I)",
      "sourcePage": 82,
      "sourceIndex": 2287
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. He taught ___ English.",
      "sourcePage": 82,
      "sourceIndex": 2288
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. He；2. her；3. my；4. mine；5. himself",
      "sourcePage": 83,
      "sourceIndex": 2289
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— GF5 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“GF5”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 83,
      "sourceIndex": 2290
    }
  ],
